# Medusa backend

Business logic belongs in workflows and module services, not route handlers. Routes resolve input, then run a workflow.

Subscribe checkout eligibility lives in `resolveCartSubscription`. `POST /store/carts/:id/subscribe` must keep defaulting a subscribe line item to monthly/period 1 when cart metadata is missing. After changing that path, run:

`cd apps/backend && npm run test:unit -- src/lib/__tests__/resolve-cart-subscription.unit.spec.ts`

Do not rewrite existing module migrations. Do not use raw SQL or a direct DB client. Do not disable `@medusajs/*` ESLint rules; fix the pattern instead.
